<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Không tìm thấy | MEU CMS</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>

<body
    class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-9xl font-bold text-white/20">404</h1>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4 -mt-8">Không tìm thấy trang</h2>
        <p class="text-white/80 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
            Trang bạn đang tìm kiếm không tồn tại hoặc đã bị di chuyển.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="/" class="bg-white text-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-medium hover:bg-white/90 transition">
                Về trang chủ
            </a>
            <button onclick="history.back()"
                class="bg-white/20 text-white border-2 border-white/50 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-medium hover:bg-white/30 transition">
                Quay lại
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>